        "bodyText": "Unofficial historical educational preservation (not affiliated with Blizzard) • 2008-05-12 21:00:44 snapshot • no user data collection 2008 archive · Historical exhibit 2008 World of Warcraft trial selector This page preserves the captured trial selector as a static historical exhibit. The former trial service and its account destinations are retired. The capture presented two side-by-side choices for visitors who wanted to learn about a ten-day trial: Burning CrusadeThe left-hand choice in the captured selector. World of WarcraftThe right-hand choice in the captured selector. What remains missing The split-panel and footer artwork referenced under images/ has not been recovered. Registration is unavailable in this historical exhibit. Return to the local archive home",
